title Cassette playback VOLUME: muted it reads Mute (- does nothing, = brings 50 % back); a card without a level control: SOFT at the full width while recording, VOLUME in the same place while the take plays
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO nocard
env CASSETTE_DEMO_VOLUME mute
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "CARD"
shot nocard-recording
key x
wait 300
key space
wait 400
expect text "VOLUME"
expect text "Mute"
expect notext "SOFT"
shot nocard-volume-mute
type -
wait 300
expect text "Mute"
say - while muted does nothing
type =
wait 300
expect text "50 %"
expect notext "Mute"
say = un-mutes at the level it had
shot nocard-volume
key x
wait 300
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "VOLUME"
expect notext "CARD"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
